  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！升降梯倒了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再往下一點點，我、我的腿就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......拉住我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是說拉住我的造物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "笨蛋......你別把我也拽倒了啊！帶著你們，我本來就很難浮起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "長、長官......謝謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下回滾得更機靈些，少給我添亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "長官，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是......是炮彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，要比一般的榴彈炮厲害得多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......而且，僅僅瞄準了這一小塊區域？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曼弗雷德......你是不是早就在看著了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死的心機深沉的魔族佬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽好了，都給我停止行動！這些薩卡茲沒有追的必要了，至於那個司機......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這倒楣地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中尉，這、這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城防炮怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......倫蒂尼姆的防禦牆建成近七十年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是第一次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "牆上的防禦炮，瞄準目標包含了......城內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "威力不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只用上了一成火力，就能輕鬆熔毀普通結構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這可是倫蒂尼姆的城防武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還只是副炮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的武器專家說，如果我能啟動主炮，這些炮能輕鬆擊穿任意一艘高速戰艦的裝甲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "武器專家......是那位城防軍工兵隊的軍官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多虧你幫我抓到了他和他的妻女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......他還活著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲還用得上他，他就不會死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "炮手，瞄準十一號升降梯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......偏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜，準度還需要提升。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟這些炮口原本只能對外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對外......在我們進入倫蒂尼姆之前，這些城防炮瞄準的是城外大公爵的軍隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當我們假借平息公爵爭端的名義入城的時候，它們甚至都沒有把我們的人納入過瞄準範圍——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這也算對外嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自從高盧戰敗、伊比利亞沉寂之後，維多利亞已很久不需要應對實質上的外敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，所以殿下為我們謀到了這個機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如此精良的武器，本就該發揮更大作用，而不是架在這裡，充當點綴門楣的裝飾品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "炮手，啟動活動目標動態追蹤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很好，成功了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給它們調整朝向就耗費了我們整整一個月的時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所幸效果基本達標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "控制住了這批武器，就意味著我們真正控制住了倫蒂尼姆的出入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等我們把所有城防炮都調整好......就再沒有人能躲在鋼鐵高牆的蔭蔽之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "炮火似乎被深池引開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是......一次試驗？他們的目的難道僅僅只是驗證......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，他們真正的目標並不是這出入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中尉，我們怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......繼續往城內方向撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是......薩迪恩區的其他地方也不再安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲對倫蒂尼姆的控制正在收緊。只要城防炮對準城內一天，我們的性命就隨時都捏在他們手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除非......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您在想什麼，中尉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒什麼。走吧，先離開這裡再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這該死的城牆，該死的炮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "長官，您的造物又被擊碎了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我根本......來不及！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別愣著了，滾，有多快滾多快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......逼著我們從這裡逃跑是吧？曼弗雷德，你今天這麼戲耍我，我早晚都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "長官，我剛才看到有個熟悉的人影朝相反方向跑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個人......褐色頭髮的魯珀？是她？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "給我攔下——\n唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "長官，小心！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你做什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "長官，我擋著，您快走，快走吧......您還要替領袖......找......找到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是第十三個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "十三條塔拉人的命。我會替領袖記住，有朝一日，我要親手、成倍地問薩卡茲討回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "將軍，深池的隊伍完全被打散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我們沒注意到反抗軍......這幫狡猾的蟲豸！他們好像就露了一下頭，城防炮啟動以後，就又不見了蹤影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，他們會不會已經被打死了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我就覺得我們的工作不至於這麼輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明白就好。"
    },
    {
