      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那他們是混進逃走的人群裡了嗎？要不要通知巡邏隊，讓他們攔住平民，繼續搜捕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "繼續炮轟出入口。對了，加大力度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "加大火力？出入口已經爛得差不多了，不太可能藏人......"
