      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們不會再走這條路了。而且，你見過薩卡茲拔刀只拔一半的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然動了手，不如讓他們看看清楚，我們能做到什麼程度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你是故意在他們面前彰顯力量。你想......斷了他們的後路，逼他們自己走出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這場捉迷藏耗時夠久了。即便我還能等，殿下們與諸王庭也都已失去耐心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不論是誰，有所圖謀的話，我只想麻煩他們快一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
