      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，附近沒有一處位置是絕對安全的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算我們全部撤到了這塊結構下面，也還是......"
