        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而且沒有下一次機會了啊，我的寶貝無人機全被打爛了，就算是我，也沒法原地給你們再變一批出來......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "往前往後都不算安全，想逃出轟炸區，我們還是要冒很大的險。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "能有一條讓我們繞開這裡的路就好了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "聽說你們在找路？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "欸欸？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "誰在這裡？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "卡特斯小姐，我想和你們談一談。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但在此之前，你最好讓你的手下把武器都從我身上移開。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你——你是什麼人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "自我介紹得稍後再說了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "鋼爪，砍刀，還有這位......呃，這位手上的錘子？女士，你的武器看起來非常帥，但能不能不要對著我的腦袋？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不然的話，你們的這位朋友可能會有生命危險。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——博士！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊？發生了什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他說的是我？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "誰都別靠近。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只要有人走近一步，這位朋友的後腦勺就會原地爆開。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿、阿米婭，是無人機......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "有一架無人機，趁我們大家不注意，偷偷繞了過去，現在正貼在博士後腦勺上啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "尖耳朵的女士，你很識貨。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "實話說，我對你們真的越來越好奇了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大家，放下武器。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯，這才對嘛。不過別忘記撤掉角落裡那些弩。我敢打賭，自從我站到你們面前，你們的狙擊手就沒眨過眼睛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......照他說的做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "請你相信我，我們從來不會主動地給任何陌生人造成傷害。但是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但凡你敢傷害你面前的人，請同樣相信我，我可以不依賴任何武器，現在，立刻，讓你永遠失去威脅別人的能力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "咳咳......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔呃......這地方已經夠危險了，動手之前我們可能都會被炸死啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沒錯，要是不想一起被薩卡茲炸成禮花的話，我們恐怕沒時間站在這裡互相指腦袋了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "各位，我有個建議，請你們放棄抵抗，跟我走一趟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在到地方之前，你們這位朋友還是借我一用——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
